A C4 diagram describes software architecture at four levels of zoom: System Context, Containers, Components, and Code. Each level uses labeled shapes for people, systems, and containers with explicit relationship arrows. ''New in Mermaid 10.'' Uses `C4Context`, `C4Container`, `C4Component`.

---

!! Basic example

```
C4Context
    Person(user, "User", "A person using the system.")
    System(webapp, "Web Application", "Delivers content to users.")
    Rel(user, webapp, "Uses", "HTTPS")
```

$$$text/vnd.tiddlywiki.mermaid
C4Context
    Person(user, "User", "A person using the system.")
    System(webapp, "Web Application", "Delivers content to users.")
    Rel(user, webapp, "Uses", "HTTPS")
$$$

